  "bodyHash": "ece809ab1160d76e",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/827/597/parkour-effects.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"802\" height=\"78\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這裡提供了一張跑酷地圖，獨特的藥水效果將為你帶來難忘的體驗！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">沿著路線前進，克服艱難的障礙，親身體驗藥水效果的魔法魅力。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">豐富的感官震撼正等待著你，從色彩繽紛的爆炸與煙霧，到驚雷與瀑布，應有盡有。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">將想像化為現實，在這款融合藥水效果的跑酷地圖中享受難忘的時刻。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">準備好迎接難忘的體驗與美好的回憶吧！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/827/598/effects.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"394\" height=\"78\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/d/d8/Black_Concrete.png/150px-Black_Concrete.png?version=53842fb4b72c61539a1bdc5df5833f6b\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\"><strong>黑色 死亡</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gameplayerr.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Block_Gray_Concrete.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">灰色 終點</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/c/c8/Light_Gray_Concrete.png/150px-Light_Gray_Concrete.png?version=f06eeae312d185b5f9c51f14127b09ce\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">淺灰色 檢查點</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/8/8d/Cyan_Concrete.png/150px-Cyan_Concrete.png?version=160b706c20e4f799d8913a7fc021f923\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">青色 漂浮</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/a/a1/Purple_Concrete.png?version=4baa157a9d391a98246f5e0e3508cc40\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">紫色 失明</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/9/99/Blue_Concrete.png/150px-Blue_Concrete.png?version=49aa2afc98697c4b916a5efa01657dba\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">藍色 夜視</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://minecraft.gamepedia.com/media/minecraft.gamepedia.com/thumb/7/76/Brown_Concrete.png/150px-Brown_Concrete.png?version=88eec05bfa3e1a86ae6de22ff83d6d88\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">棕色 極度緩慢</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_br_gamepedia/thumb/a/a7/Concreto_Verde.png/225px-Concreto_Verde.png?version=4fb4b18a391f68f972c21c94553edcd2\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">綠色 緩慢</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/4/46/Pink_Concrete.png/150px-Pink_Concrete.png?version=a6023e7944173dcfc70060ca607462eb\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">粉紅色 水下呼吸</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/4/4d/Lime_Concrete.png/150px-Lime_Concrete.png?version=ec00c54d8ce6efcbaccbfbf7a738d93d\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">黃綠色 跳躍提升</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/8/8b/Yellow_Concrete.png/150px-Yellow_Concrete.png?version=0e0f54bd84113a0558c9e06331b92f23\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">黃色 金幣</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/3/37/Red_Concrete.png/150px-Red_Concrete.png?version=cfe56b0814b7c17c041cd2ebec5d4d24\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">紅色 屏障</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/0/07/Orange_Concrete.png/150px-Orange_Concrete.png?version=a834c66cd6daddc808337dd9268c1145\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">橘色 火焰抗性</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/3/31/Magenta_Concrete.png/150px-Magenta_Concrete.png?version=c1c4a2768394748b6943f43498a67be5\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">品紅色 生命恢復</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://gamepedia.cursecdn.com/minecraft_gamepedia/thumb/6/60/Light_Blue_Concrete.png/150px-Light_Blue_Concrete.png?version=aeb50e3e227d2f8257ed54e2eafd5d66\" alt=\"\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\">淺藍色 速度提升</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/827/615/levels.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"323\" height=\"78\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/827/608/map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/827/612/map3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/827/611/map2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
